  "body": "Found by the review of PR #3687.\n\n## What happens\n\nA project links an external model file with a relative path. Since PR #3687 the link watch resolves that path against the folder of the project file. After Save As into a different folder, the same relative path points into the new folder. The file is not there, and the link watch reports that the linked file cannot be read.\n\n## Expected\n\nAfter Save As, the link still reaches the same file: the stored path changes to stay correct, or the message names the cause and the fix.\n\n## Done means\n\n- A test saves a project with a relative link into a different folder and reads the link state.\n- The behaviour is one of the two above, and a decision file says which.\n\nRefs #3686.\n",
